{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a Verifier’s OpenID4VP request: show who is asking and what,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"let the holder choose, and present exactly that."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Verifier asks with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" link, as a QR code or a link on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its page. Register the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp"},{"type":"text","text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"links open the app, and hand the link to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startPresentation(request:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". It fetches the Verifier’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signed request, checks its certificate against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and finds the credentials that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can answer it. A request from a Verifier the wallet doesn’t trust"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/untrustedVerifier"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything is shown."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation","type":"reference"},{"text":" it returns says:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"who is asking: ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/verifier-swift.property","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", its name, and its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Registration","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" when a registrar the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wallet trusts (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/registrarRoots","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":") registered it,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with its purpose and the claims it’s registered to ask for;","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"what it asks for: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/queries","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", each with the held"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials that can answer it, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/credentialSets","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the request’s alternatives."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Present","anchor":"Present"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Answers a request link: `confirm` shows the holder who is asking and","\/\/\/ what sharing would disclose, and returns whether they agree. Returns","\/\/\/ where to send the browser, when the Verifier asks.","func present(requestLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             confirm: (Presentation, [Presentation.Disclosure]) async -> Bool) async throws -> URL? {","    let presentation: Presentation","    do {","        presentation = try await wallet.startPresentation(request: requestLink)","    } catch let error as WalletError where error.code == .requestRefused {","        \/\/ A refused request: the Verifier was told, and may say where to","        \/\/ take the holder next (OpenID4VP §8.2).","        return wallet.takeRefusalRedirect()","    }","    guard presentation.isAnswerable else {","        return try await presentation.decline().redirectURI","    }","    let selection: Presentation.Selection","    let disclosures: [Presentation.Disclosure]","    do {","        selection = try await presentation.defaultSelection()","        disclosures = try await presentation.preview(selection: selection)","    } catch {","        \/\/ Nothing can be shown: decline, so the Verifier isn't left waiting.","        _ = try? await presentation.decline()","        throw error","    }","    guard await confirm(presentation, disclosures) else {","        return try await presentation.decline().redirectURI","    }","    \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks for it.","    return try await presentation.respond(selection: selection).redirectURI","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/defaultSelection()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" picks the first credential that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"answers each query, and the first answerable option of each credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set. To let the holder choose, build a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Selection","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each query’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/credentials","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instead: a query that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes one credential gets exactly one. The wallet presents exactly the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selection, after checking it answers the request"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/invalidSelection","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" otherwise), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/preview(selection:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" says what it would disclose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without signing or sending anything: show that before the holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"agrees."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Open ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Presented\/redirectURI"},{"text":", when the Verifier sends","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"one, in the browser the request came from: it’s how a same-device"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flow returns to the Verifier’s page. The library refuses http and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"schemes that run code or read local data, but lets through a scheme the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Verifier’s own app may have registered: open an https URL in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"browser, any other only through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIApplication.open"},{"type":"text","text":", never in a web"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view, and never one in the wallet’s own schemes ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer"},{"type":"text","text":", its redirect URI’s), which would start"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"another flow in the wallet."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"When the wallet refuses a request","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"When-the-wallet-refuses-a-request"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A request the wallet must not answer — one with ","type":"text"},{"code":"transaction_data","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t support, or a parameter OpenID4VP forbids — makes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startPresentation(request:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" throw","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/requestRefused","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", its ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/protocolError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the error code the wallet sent the Verifier, such as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalid_transaction_data"},{"text":". Nothing is shown to the holder, and nothing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is presented. The Verifier may answer the refusal with a redirect:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/takeRefusalRedirect()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" returns it, once, and you open it in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the browser the request came from, as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Presented\/redirectURI","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", so the holder isn’t left","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stranded. Tell the holder the request wasn’t answered.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Show what’s being asked beyond a registration","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Show-whats-being-asked-beyond-a-registration"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For a Verifier with a verified registration, each query’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/unregistered","isActive":true},{"text":" lists the claims it asks for beyond","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what it’s registered to request, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/unregisteredAll","isActive":true},{"text":" whether it names no claims at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"all. The library flags such a query in full, though OpenID4VP 1.0","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"§6.4.1 reads it as asking for no selectively disclosable claims, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presentation for it discloses only what the credential always shows.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Nothing is refused for them: show them, and let the holder decide.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Keep presentations unlinkable","level":3,"anchor":"Keep-presentations-unlinkable","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each presentation uses a copy of the credential, bound to its own key,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so two Verifiers can’t link the holder’s presentations by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credential. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/copyPolicy-swift.property","type":"reference"},{"text":" chooses which copy:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/CopyPolicy-swift.enum\/perPresentation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", the default: a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"copy no Verifier has seen, every time."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/CopyPolicy-swift.enum\/perVerifier"},{"type":"text","text":": the copy a Verifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has seen before, so it can recognize a returning holder, and an unused"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one for a new Verifier."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once every copy is used, one is reused. A candidate’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" says whether presenting it now would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hand this Verifier a copy another has seen: warn the holder, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refresh the credential ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") when its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" reaches zero."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"When delivery is uncertain","type":"heading","anchor":"When-delivery-is-uncertain","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If sending the response fails in a way that leaves it unknown whether","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Verifier received it, ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/respond(selection:)","isActive":true},{"text":" throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/deliveryUnknown","isActive":true},{"text":" and doesn’t send it again: the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder should check with the Verifier before sharing again.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingfromalink"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/RequestLink"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Presenting-from-a-link","title":"Presenting from a link"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"Presenting from a link","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"role":"article"},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Presentation/verifier-swift.property":{"abstract":[{"text":"Who is asking.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/verifier-swift.property","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentation\/verifier-swift.property","title":"verifier","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"verifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet12PresentationC8VerifierV","text":"Verifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/invalidInput":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An argument, a link or the configuration is malformed."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/invalidinput","title":"invalidInput","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"invalidInput"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","text":"WalletError"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","text":"Code"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/invalidInput","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Presentation/respond(selection:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Presents exactly "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"selection"},{"type":"text","text":": holder keys sign now, so a key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store requiring user presence prompts."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/respond(selection:)","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentation\/respond(selection:)","title":"respond(selection:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"respond"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"selection"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet12PresentationC9Selectiona","text":"Selection"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet12PresentationC9PresentedV","text":"Presented"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Presentation/Registration":{"title":"Presentation.Registration","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Verifier’s registration with a registrar: who it is and what it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"may request, as the registrar attests."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentation\/registration","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Registration","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Registration"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Registration"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/protocolError":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The remote party’s OAuth error code, such as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalid_grant"},{"type":"text","text":" (a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wrong PIN) or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"access_denied"},{"type":"text","text":", when it gave one. For"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/invalidInput","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" it’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"not_configured"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MobileDetailNotConfigured"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the wallet’s configuration lacks what the call needs — such"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"as ","type":"text"},{"code":"issuerRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"redirectURI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to receive credentials, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"verifierRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to present them — rather than an argument being","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"malformed: the app’s configuration to fix, which ","type":"text"},{"code":"message","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" names","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by its JSON key (","type":"text"},{"code":"issuer_roots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/protocolError","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/protocolerror","title":"protocolError","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"protocolError"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/refreshCredential(id:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Replaces a ","type":"text"},{"code":"refreshable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" credential’s copies with a fresh batch,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each bound to a new holder key, without the holder signing in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(OpenID4VCI 1.0 §13.5). The new holder keys sign the Credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Request’s proof, so with ","type":"text"},{"code":"KeychainKeyStore.Options.holderUserPresence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on it asks the holder. Use it when ","type":"text"},{"code":"copiesLeft","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" runs low. Throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"WalletError.Code.reissueRequired","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when it can’t be refreshed:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"receive it again from a new offer.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/refreshcredential(id:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)","title":"refreshCredential(id:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"refreshCredential","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Refreshed","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet6WalletC9RefreshedV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/untrustedVerifier":{"abstract":[{"text":"The Verifier’s request is signed with a certificate that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t chain to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verifierRoots"},{"text":": it’s refused unread.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/untrustedverifier","title":"untrustedVerifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/untrustedVerifier","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","t